# RFC 5545 requires CRLF line endings, and GitHub Pages serves whatever bytes are
# stored in the repo. This machine has core.autocrlf=true, which would quietly
# rewrite the calendar files to LF on commit and publish a malformed feed.
# -text disables all conversion so the .ics bytes survive the round trip intact.
*.ics -text

# Keep the rest normalized as usual.
*.py text
*.md text
*.html text
*.json text
